      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.27 (down from ₹4.57 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹74.5m (down 16% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹7.21m (down 50% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 9.7% (down from 17% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 12% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 3% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
