      "body": "Second quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹6.47 (up from ₹4.61 in 2Q 2025). Revenue: ₹88.2m (down 9.8% from 2Q 2025). Net income: ₹20.6m (up 40% from 2Q 2025). Profit margin: 23% (up from 15% in 2Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 8% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 14% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
